  "description": "*\\[Welcome to Murim Online, the world where the strongest reside.\\]\n\n\\[Your device has malfunctioned, and logging out failed.\\]\n\n\\[Would you like to attempt to disconnect once more?\\]\n\n\\[Yes or No\\]*\n\nWhen he tried returning to virtual reality, the place he logged into was instead the “real Murim.” A once-in-an-era psychopath fell into the Murim due to the Grim Reaper’s mistake. Dong Bongsu's merciless fangs cast a shadow over Murim, which is rife with schemes and malice.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
